drm/amd/display: Apple iMac 5K lean stack for Debian Linux 6.12

Port of the 7.x lean core, stitching, link recovery, suspend and DCE 12 fixes.
Adapt the legacy fbdev/EDID/scaling APIs while retaining sink EDID ownership.
Includes the root-plane zero-width guard merged in PR #15.
Based on Linux 6.12.113; see patches/README.md for provenance and validation.

